{"id":"e99f04960feca433864dde9a21270ab19178335b","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/030/407.htm","title":"魅族 MIFI N1 随身 Wi-Fi 发售：搭移芯 EC800LE 芯片，3000mAh 电池，39 元起","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：漾仔","excerpt":"新品搭载移芯 EC800LE 芯片，支持 Wi-Fi 6 协议、3000mAh 电池和 16 台设备同时接入。##魅族 MIFI N1#","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            \r\n            <p data-vmark=\"041a\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 11 月 21 日消息，魅族 MIFI N1 随身 Wi-Fi 现已在京东上架发售，首发价 39 元起。</p><dir><a href=\"https://u.jd.com/o1VQdKR\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oaVCS7i\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oaVtyJB\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oGVzAcz\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/oGVscm9\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/o6VL4O9\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oD7osAl\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fo17h8nD%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-itwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/orVbggM\" data-lpwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/oD7hcqG\" data-ncid=\"277237\" contenteditable=\"false\"><span><span><img src=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/528485/3/14324/57397/6ac71148Ffeb14460/00833e83e8f18a20.png\" w=\"1000\" h=\"1000\" title=\"魅族 MIFI N1 随身 Wi-Fi 发售：搭移芯 EC800LE 芯片，3000mAh 电池，39 元起\" data-original=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/528485/3/14324/57397/6ac71148Ffeb14460/00833e83e8f18a20.png\" width=\"1000\" height=\"820\"></span><span><span><span>京东</span><span>魅族随身 Wi-Fi</span></span><span></span><span><span> 券后 39 元</span><span>领 5 元券</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p data-vmark=\"afb9\">据介绍，这款随身 Wi-Fi 搭载移芯 EC800LE，集成基带、射频、电源管理，支持智能切网；尺寸为 96.6×58×14.8mm，重约 102g；支持 Wi-Fi 6 协议，下行峰值 150Mbps；电池容量 3000mAh，通过 3C 认证，最多支持 16 台设备同时接入。</p><p data-vmark=\"ce83\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/11/ab7a8b5b-c8b2-4ab3-a693-45356cb358ae.jpg\" w=\"1080\" h